{"title":"助力轨道交通实现“四网融合”——4项铁路工程建设行业标准发布","date":"2024-07-24","content":"<p>\r\n\t&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span style=\"font-size:21.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;mso-color-alt:windowtext;\r\nletter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">助力轨道交通实现&ldquo;四网融合&rdquo;</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:21.0pt;font-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;color:black;\r\nmso-color-alt:windowtext;mso-font-kerning:18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\">&mdash;&mdash;<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing:.4pt\">4</span><span style=\"letter-spacing:\r\n.4pt\">项铁路工程建设行业标准发布</span></span></b></p>\r\n<p align=\"center\" class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 6pt; text-align: center; line-height: normal; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;\">\r\n\t<b><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:21.0pt;\r\nfont-family:华文中宋;mso-bidi-font-family:宋体;letter-spacing:.4pt;mso-font-kerning:\r\n18.0pt;mso-ligatures:none\"><o:p></o:p></span></b></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">近日，国家铁路局发布《城际铁路设计规范》局部修订条文和《市域（郊）铁路工程静态和动态验收技术规范（试行）》《铁路<span lang=\"EN-US\">CBTC</span>信号设计规范》《铁路<span lang=\"EN-US\">LTE</span>移动通信系统设计规范》等<span lang=\"EN-US\">4</span>项&ldquo;四网融合&rdquo;亟需的铁路行业工程建设标准。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">&ldquo;四网融合&rdquo;指的是干线铁路、城际铁路、市域（郊）铁路和城市轨道交通的融合。推动轨道交通&ldquo;四网融合&rdquo;是党中央、国务院作出的重大决策部署，也是交通强国的重要内容，旨在实现各种交通方式的连接贯通，更加方便人民群众的出行，更好服务区域经济社会发展。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">近年来，随着我国城市群和都市圈的不断发展，人民群众对轨道交通&ldquo;四网融合&rdquo;，特别是地铁和城际铁路、市域（郊）铁路的互联互通、融合发展需求日益迫切。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">今年以来，国家铁路局深入贯彻落实党中央、国务院关于轨道交通&ldquo;四网融合&rdquo;的决策部署，在粤港澳大湾区等重点地区进行试点，大力推动轨道交通的设施互联、票制互通、安检互信、信息共享。<span lang=\"EN-US\">1</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">23</span>日，国家铁路局会同广东省及国铁集团，推动莞惠、佛肇城际实现自主运营。<span lang=\"EN-US\">5</span>月<span lang=\"EN-US\">26</span>日肇庆到惠州实现城际铁路&ldquo;四线贯通&rdquo;运营，广受人民群众欢迎，运量大幅提升。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">然而，由于地铁和铁路存在制式不统一、标准不统一和管理不一致等问题，轨道交通在基础设施&ldquo;硬联通&rdquo;和规则标准&ldquo;软联通&rdquo;方面还存在一些卡点和堵点。本次<span lang=\"EN-US\">4</span>项标准的发布，主要针对这些卡点和堵点，推进规则标准&ldquo;软联通&rdquo;，助力打造轨道上的城市群都市圈，更好服务区域一体化发展。该<span lang=\"EN-US\">4</span>项标准由中国铁设、铁四院、中铁上海院等单位编制。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">《城际铁路设计规范》局部修订条文新增了推动&ldquo;四网融合&rdquo;发展的导向性要求，允许客流特点及运输需求等明显具有市域（郊）铁路特征的城际铁路执行《市域（郊）铁路设计规范》。《市域（郊）铁路工程静态和动态验收技术规范（试行）》统一和规范了市域（郊）铁路工程静态验收和动态验收技术要求和质量标准。《铁路<span lang=\"EN-US\">CBTC</span>信号设计规范》《铁路<span lang=\"EN-US\">LTE</span>移动通信系统设计规范》针对城际和市域（郊）铁路接入城市中心、公交化运营等实际需求，解决了铁路与城市轨道交通在通信、信号制式方面的兼容性难题。公众可登录国家铁路局政府网站主页《标准规范》栏目查询相关信息。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">下一步，国家铁路局将加快形成中国特色的行业标准，来指导全国各地的&ldquo;四网融合&rdquo;工作。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">在设施互联方面，将聚焦多运营主体、多层次轨道交通互联互通需求，制定基础设施、机车客车、牵引供电、通信信号等互联互通技术规范，研究构建互联互通接入规则。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">在票制互通方面，将制定票制互通、支付兼容等相关标准，研究制定票制互通工程实施方案，积极拓展&ldquo;一次购票、一次支付&rdquo;服务模式。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">在安检互信方面，将促进铁路和地铁安检标准的衔接互认，完善换乘条件，更新补强安检设施设备，进一步优化安检流程。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">在信息共享方面，将研究数据资源开放共享机制和交换渠道，制定数据采集、数据安全管理等标准，促进各类信息的开放共享。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0\">\r\n\t<span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:\r\n华文中宋\">&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:7.8pt;mso-para-margin-bottom:.5gd;\r\ntext-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:32.0pt;mso-char-indent-count:\r\n2.0\">\r\n\t<span style=\"font-size:16.0pt;line-height:115%;font-family:华文中宋\">在管理协同方面，将研究制定相关制度办法，完善铁路运输基础设备、车辆、驾驶人员资格等许可，推进铁路和地铁在设备运用、运营组织、从业人员等方面的管理互通。<span lang=\"EN-US\"><o:p></o:p></span></span></p>"}